{"name":"Pink Punch","hex":"#d04a70","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color reminiscent of pinks, the flowers.","Magenta, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a colour between red and white; pale red.","Of a fox-hunter's jacket: scarlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pink"},{"term":"punch","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A hit or strike with one's fist.","A blow from something other than the fist."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To strike with one's fist.","To herd (cattle) as a cowboy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/punch"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pink Punch","blocks":[{"text":"Pink Punch is the debut extended play by South Korean girl group Rocket Punch. The album was released digitally and physically on August 7, 2019 by Woollim Entertainment. The EP contains six tracks with the lead single \"Bim Bam Bum\"."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/44/PinkPunch-EP.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink_Punch","wikidata":"Q7196089"},{"title":"Punch (monkey)","blocks":[{"text":"Punch-kun , or simply Punch, sometimes also referred to as Punch Monkey, is a baby Japanese macaque, or snow monkey, at the Ichikawa City Zoo in Japan. He gained viral attention on social media for his attachment to a large orangutan stuffed toy. Punch's internet popularity led to a surge in visitors to the zoo starting in February 2026."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Punch_the_Monkey_Ichikawa_City_Zoo_2026_2.png/330px-Punch_the_Monkey_Ichikawa_City_Zoo_2026_2.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punch_(monkey)","wikidata":"Q138358320"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint o